WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,340
Sitting in the office bored

2
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,180
Occasionally look at some of your company’s documents

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:06,250
She only understood a little bit. I'm going to call the nurse.

4
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:07,330
I'll take your temperature again

5
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:08,450
See if the fever has gone down a bit

6
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:11,560
Pilot first and then advance

7
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,240
How does she even know this?

8
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,360
I seem to be unable to understand her more and more.

9
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:25,580
I came here during a break from rehearsal. How are you feeling much better now?

10
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,500
Come over and rehearse without delay.

11
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,740
Stop worrying about my heart

12
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,300
Do you still have a fever? What did the doctor say?

13
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,180
It's nothing serious. Don't worry.

14
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,660
I always take a break these two days

15
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:39,060
If the company knows about it in advance, don’t forget to eat when you’re rehearsing. I’m sensible.

16
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,420
Take good care of yourself first

17
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,540
Break time is coming and I have to go back

18
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:44,660
I'll call you later. Slow down on the road.

19
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:47,100
I'm sorry to bother you here.

20
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:54,560
If you don’t have time the day after tomorrow, why are you still going to give it to him?

21
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,760
Also arrange a return ticket.

22
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,120
He doesn’t necessarily like to see you singing and dancing on stage.

23
00:00:58,440 --> 00:01:00,040
If you don’t say it, it’s okay if you say so.

24
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,960
Then I must let him wait.

25
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:04,320
I'll ask someone to send you another ticket, Chen Yundong

26
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:06,600
You must go the night after tomorrow. If you can't make it,

27
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:07,520
I'm not done with you

28
00:01:09,170 --> 00:01:10,250
What do you want me to do the night after tomorrow?

29
00:01:10,410 --> 00:01:14,290
I want you to go to a concert. Whose concert is it? Are you stupid? She is a singer.

30
00:01:14,290 --> 00:01:18,930
Whose concert did you want you to go to? Her concert is right. The day after tomorrow, she will have a solo concert at the Donghai Stadium.
